","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":625364452,"name":"Foam FPS","desc":"PREMIUM BENIFITS: 1.5X Cash and XP boost in-game! \n\nFoam FPS is a foam flinging first person shooter where you tag your friends and foes in an ultimate foam flinging experience! You'll be able to customize between 40+ different guns and play on multiple maps and game modes! \n\nVersion 6.21\n8/12/2024 changelog:\n- Brought back character customizer\n- Store now has a PolicyService check, this means the game will be playable in stricter countries\n- Optimized bullet lag and trails\n- Fixed mobile jump button\n- Re-added FFA and Gun Game score UI\n- Adjusted blue v orange score UI \n\nI'm working at another roblox game studio, I was dev on the Jaws: Infested Waters experience, so this is still a side thing that I'm not going to update for very much longer.","path":"/game/625364452-foam-fps","slug":"625364452-foam-fps","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/47f82258c63447d9b06656a39379794f488d9bd48760c94b7fe1c375b3220cad.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-560fc888332b9b97b758687202518193/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":50510274,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-09-08T15:09:23.576Z","creator":{"name":"IsaacThePooper","type":"User"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":5534891288,"name":"Project: SCP","desc":"Project SCP is a round-based casual (not very competitive) SCP game for all platforms and even supports VR.\nyour objective is to escape the facility either as a D-Class or Researcher\n\n\nKeyboard Controls:\nE | interact\nTab  | Inventory\nLeft Shift  | Run\nLeft Click | Shoot/Attack\nRight Click | Aim\nP   | Disable/Enable GUIs\nM  | Admin Menu (VIP Servers)\nN  | Player list\nF  | Inspect weapon (only work on a few)\n\nBadge Icons by franbos4 & Callio_Saiyan\nOwner - Aaro_1\nScripting - Aaro_1 / anexpia\nBuilding - franbos4 / Citrinities / anexpia\nModeling - franbos4\n\nMusic Composer - astowo\nAmbience Composer - LeFormula / panzerv1\n\nGame Inspired By - SCP : SL\n\nContent relating to the SCP Foundation, including the SCP Foundation logo, is licensed under Creative Commons Sharealike 3.0 and all concepts originate from the scp wiki and its authors.","path":"/game/5534891288-project-scp","slug":"5534891288-project-scp","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/514101c27717bc83d9102fbb00eca975931913c45ad9f49636f4a2dcdb9017bd.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a001b5fa1a6247bdfc802ff3510c3286/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":27658364,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-09T12:50:55.120Z","creator":{"name":"Project : SCP","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":3056526277,"name":"Build and Survive! Classic","desc":"Build a fort, upgrade, and survive!","path":"/game/3056526277-build-and-survive-classic","slug":"3056526277-build-and-survive-classic","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7494d9548fa0cf58bb20ec5518fe87ef0399531cdb1be1b4ad79942d228ed104.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-f59ec989d2fe4bd20979c858496c8673/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":179725285,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-04-22T03:56:22.382Z","creator":{"name":"BIG Games™","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":7,"freeCount":7,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":5857383913,"name":"[RUSSIA 🇷🇺] Building Architect","desc":"Do you have what it takes to become the best builder in the world? Become the richest construction manager of all time and create your empire from famous buildings to historic landmarks.\n\n🇷🇺 Added new region\n\n🔔🔔🔔 Make sure to hit the FOLLOW button to get notified when new updates drop! 🔔🔔🔔","path":"/game/5857383913-building-architect","slug":"5857383913-building-architect","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6b5da70ba9e0079d62602e7cdde04a87a71ee704adc765fc4ac504d1a7576d20.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180